{
  "uid": "saucerjam-players",
  "title": "SaucerJam: Players & game",
  "description": "Official SaucerJam product dashboard: engagement, player friction, and the community to AI loop.",
  "tags": [
    "saucerjam",
    "product",
    "official"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Service health (SLOs)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/saucerjam-health"
    },
    {
      "title": "Players & game",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/saucerjam-players"
    },
    {
      "title": "Runbooks (docs/SRE.md)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/menezmethod/saucerjam/blob/main/docs/SRE.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Players & game: product health, not reliability\nThese are **business/product metrics**: are people playing, coming back, struggling?\nGoogle keeps these **separate from SLOs** on purpose: a quiet Tuesday isn't an outage, and you should never get paged because fewer people played.\nUse this board to decide **what to build next**. Use the Service health board to decide **what to fix now**."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Engagement: are people playing and coming back?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Distinct pilots (7d)",
      "description": "Unique players (hashed tokens, no personal data) seen in the last 7 days.\nThe best single \"is this game alive?\" number. It's the retention signal the Start Here checklist asks about: do people come back next week?",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "saucerjam_distinct_pilots_7d",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pilots online now",
      "description": "Human players connected right now.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "saucerjam_players",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Rounds finished (24h)",
      "description": "Matches played to the end. Joins without finished rounds = people bail mid-match. Worth asking why in feedback.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(saucerjam_rounds_completed_total[24h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat lines (24h)",
      "description": "Social signal: players talking to each other is an early sign of community.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(saucerjam_chat_messages_total[24h])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": ""
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rounds finished by map",
      "description": "Which maps get played to the end. A map nobody finishes is a candidate for a redesign.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (map) (increase(saucerjam_rounds_completed_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{map}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Game events by type (per min)",
      "description": "What happens inside matches: fire, hit, kill, portal use, pickups.\nRatios tell a design story: hits/fire = accuracy (too low = aiming is frustrating), kills/hit = how tanky players are.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (type) (rate(saucerjam_game_events_total[5m])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{type}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Player experience: where do they struggle?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Starts vs feedback opened (per min)",
      "description": "Practice vs online starts, and how often players open the report form.\nReports rising faster than starts = something new is annoying people (often right after a deploy).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(insight_events_total{event=\"practice_start\"}[10m]))*60",
          "legendFormat": "practice starts"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(insight_events_total{event=\"online_start\"}[10m]))*60",
          "legendFormat": "online starts"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(insight_events_total{event=\"report_opened\"}[10m]))*60",
          "legendFormat": "reports opened"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Friction signals (share of sessions)",
      "description": "Behaviour hints that a player is confused, computed per session:\n- `stuck_no_input`: sat there not pressing anything\n- `died_without_kill`: never scored\n- `no_aim_fire`: firing without aiming\n- `menu_repeat`: bouncing around menus\nThese are UX smoke alarms, not errors.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "insight_friction_ratio",
          "legendFormat": "{{signal}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Struggle by device",
      "description": "Same friction signals split by device. If touch struggles far more than desktop, the mobile controls need work.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (device) (rate(insight_events_total{event=~\"died_without_kill|stuck_no_input|controls_struggle\"}[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{device}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Most-used actions (per hour)",
      "description": "What players actually click. Features nobody uses are candidates to cut.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (event) (increase(insight_events_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{event}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Community \u2192 AI loop (Fider feedback pipeline)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 32,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Feedback ingested by kind",
      "description": "Fider posts accepted into the AI queue (bug / idea). This is the input side of the automation loop.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (increase(saucerjam_community_ingest_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "AI actions recorded",
      "description": "What the automation did with feedback (triage, PR opened, and so on). Ingest without actions = the loop is stuck.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (action) (increase(saucerjam_community_actions_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{action}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Webhooks rejected / Fider errors",
      "description": "Rejected Fider webhooks by reason (bad signature, rate limit), plus `fider_last_error` = 1 when the last call to Fider failed.\nRejections from unknown sources are expected (the endpoint is public). A bad-signature rejection from Fider itself means the shared secret drifted.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prom"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(saucerjam_community_webhook_rejected_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "rejected: {{reason}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prom"
          },
          "expr": "saucerjam_fider_last_error",
          "legendFormat": "fider last call failed"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}